WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.037
♪♪

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.871
-I'm here with Post Malone.

00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:08.641
And he's gonna take me
to his favorite restaurant,

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.609
Olive Garden.
-Yeah, very excited.

00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:12.278
-Now, you have no connection
to Olive Garden.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.713
Want to put this out
before we like --

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:16.949
-Yeah, yeah. I have not been
monetarily compensated

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:18.985
by Olive Garden
to do or say anything.

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.153
-Me neither.

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.122
I've never been
to an Olive Garden ever.

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:23.990
Oh, dude, we're here.
-We're family.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.291
-Yeah.
We're here, we're family!

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.059
We're here, and we're family!
Let's do this!

00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:29.095
-We're family!
-Let's go, Olive Garden!

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:33.032
♪♪

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:34.500
-What the hell?

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.869
Thank you, sir.
-Enjoy.

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:38.771
-Your server should be
right with you, all right?

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:41.607
♪♪

00:00:41.607 --> 00:00:43.009
-Hi, folks.
How are you?

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:43.843
-I'm good.
How are you?

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.177
-Welcome to the Olive Garden.

00:00:45.177 --> 00:00:47.346
-This is my first time here.
Yes, I'm a first-timer.

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:48.815
-First-timer.
Okay, welcome.

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:50.583
-I wore olive pants.
-Ooh.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.785
-Do you have booze?
-Free wine samples.

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:53.886
Free.
-Free?

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:54.987
-Free wine samples.

00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:56.822
-Wait, I've heard
only about breadsticks.

00:00:56.822 --> 00:00:59.359
So I can eat free breadsticks
and free wine?

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:02.162
-So, you get a free wine sample
to start and breadsticks.

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:04.463
And the bread sticks
are phenomenal.

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:06.265
-Can we have the butter
with the breadsticks?

00:01:06.265 --> 00:01:08.367
Like a [bleep] load of butter?
-Extra butter.

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:09.902
-It actually
says that on the menu.

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:11.270
-[Bleep] load of butter!

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:14.006
♪♪

00:01:14.006 --> 00:01:16.108
-Hey, salute.
-Salute.

00:01:16.108 --> 00:01:17.309
-Salute.
-Salute.

00:01:17.309 --> 00:01:19.813
-Salute.

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:21.748
-What is that palate picking up?

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:24.750
-Mm.
I'm picking up some, like --

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.719
-A grape.
-Yep.

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:29.021
-Like, an alcohol type of thing
or, like, do you think --

00:01:29.021 --> 00:01:31.290
-[ Laughs ]
You think it's a grape --

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.092
-Oh [bleep] it went in my nose.

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:34.960
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.963
You can't snort the wine.
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.231
-I don't know.
Maybe you can.

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:40.332
Can we snort the wine?
-Oh, yeah!

00:01:40.332 --> 00:01:41.734
-Let's snort the wine.
Here we go.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:44.637
♪♪

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:47.206
-All right.
I'm gonna show you how to do

00:01:47.206 --> 00:01:50.310
the Olive Garden breadstick,
Post Malone-style.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.377
-This is it.

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:54.213
-Just get the butter
nice and open.

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:56.015
Pick your stick.
You get first pick.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:57.616
It's your first time here.

00:01:57.616 --> 00:01:59.452
That's your stick.
-Wow.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.855
-And what you're gonna
want to do is take a bite.

00:02:01.855 --> 00:02:03.790
-Okay.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.358
-Okay?
That's it.

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:06.892
Suck it up.
-Uh-huh.

00:02:06.892 --> 00:02:08.260
-It wasn't the best thing
you've ever had,

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:11.164
but now take your butter knife.

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:14.633
Cut about
2 millimeters of butter.

00:02:14.633 --> 00:02:17.536
Just put it on.

00:02:17.536 --> 00:02:19.505
Cheers.
-Cheers, buddy.

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:21.541
This is fun.

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.346
The contrast.

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:27.580
It's garlicky.
-Mmm.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.581
-It's salty.
-Mmm.

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:29.681
-It's buttery.
-Mmm.

00:02:29.681 --> 00:02:31.517
-It's hot, and it's cold.

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:33.453
What else do you want?
-Nothing.

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:34.821
-Holy moly.

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:38.992
And these are free?
-These are free.

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:42.695
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.030
How's that?
[ Laughs ]

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.398
-It was a mistake.

00:02:45.398 --> 00:02:48.835
♪♪

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:50.869
-So I have some salad
for you guys.

00:02:50.869 --> 00:02:52.037
-Oh.
-Thank you so much.

00:02:52.037 --> 00:02:53.038
-You're very welcome.

00:02:53.038 --> 00:02:54.206
-Healthy, too.
-Grazie.

00:02:54.206 --> 00:02:56.341
-I heard the salad's
good here, as well.

00:02:56.341 --> 00:02:58.177
-Well, it's free.
It's unlimited.

00:02:58.177 --> 00:02:59.444
-Wait. What?

00:02:59.444 --> 00:03:00.746
What do you pay for here?

00:03:00.746 --> 00:03:02.848
-Would you like some fresh
parmesan cheese on top?

00:03:02.848 --> 00:03:04.417
-You know what?
I like croutons.

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:07.219
Can I just get
a laundry basket of croutons?

00:03:07.219 --> 00:03:10.723
♪♪

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:13.125
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:15.929
-Oh, cool!

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:17.196
Cool!

00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:18.231
-While we're waiting
for the entrées.

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:19.799
-Wow!

00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:22.168
Jimmy, you're the best dad ever.

00:03:22.168 --> 00:03:24.837
♪♪

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:26.038
You look cool.

00:03:26.038 --> 00:03:27.640
-Hey, do you want to know
a little secret about me?

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.175
-Yeah.

00:03:29.175 --> 00:03:31.543
-I have a special power.
-Okay.

00:03:31.543 --> 00:03:33.980
-I can guess if you like ketchup
or if you like mustard.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.515
-Okay.

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:36.682
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.682 --> 00:03:37.816
-You ready for this?

00:03:37.816 --> 00:03:39.185
You've got to look at me
in the eye, though.

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:41.287
You think it's easy.

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:44.257
Don't try to lie and try to --
you're trying to fake me out.

00:03:44.257 --> 00:03:45.424
Look at me.

00:03:45.424 --> 00:03:47.927
Hey, can I ask you a question?

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:50.697
Where did you go
on vacation last year?

00:03:50.697 --> 00:03:51.864
-Rome.

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:53.766
-Oh, really?

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:58.771
Did you stop by to see the
ketchup at the Vatican?

00:03:58.771 --> 00:04:01.474
-[ Laughing ]

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:02.608
Am I right?

00:04:02.608 --> 00:04:03.943
-He's good.
He's good, guys.

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:05.244
-Yes!

00:04:05.244 --> 00:04:07.647
-Chris, come here.
Do it to Chris.

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:12.985
Does he like
ketchup or mustard more?

00:04:12.985 --> 00:04:14.253
-Wow.
This is tricky.

00:04:14.253 --> 00:04:16.222
-Yeah, he's good.
-'Cause he can look like --

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:17.490
-He's a brick wall.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:20.593
-I feel like my powers
are drained, but I'll try.

00:04:20.593 --> 00:04:23.562
Chris?
-Yes, sir.

00:04:23.562 --> 00:04:26.432
-Did you have
a good birthday last year?

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:27.933
You did?
-I did, yes.

00:04:27.933 --> 00:04:30.135
-Oh.
Because what was at the party?

00:04:30.135 --> 00:04:32.571
You had a cake
and you had probably

00:04:32.571 --> 00:04:36.475
a hot dog with...
mustard on it?

00:04:36.475 --> 00:04:40.079
-Oh!
He's good! Yeah!

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:41.313
-Get outta here!

00:04:41.313 --> 00:04:43.282
-He's a mustard type of guy.
Everyone knows it.

00:04:43.282 --> 00:04:44.450
-I'm exhausted!
-Everyone --

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.484
I know.
I don't blame you.

00:04:45.484 --> 00:04:48.153
♪♪

00:04:48.153 --> 00:04:49.355
-Are you ready
to place your order?

00:04:49.355 --> 00:04:51.090
-We'll take two chicken
parmesans, extra crispy.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:53.292
-Two chicken parm.
-That's my jam.

00:04:53.292 --> 00:04:55.995
-Now listen.
Don't worry about penne,

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:59.465
'cause I know you want penne,
but it's only gluten-free.

00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:01.034
So we'll have the rigatoni.

00:05:01.034 --> 00:05:02.468
-So you want --
So instead of spaghetti,

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:05.304
rigatoni with marinara on top.
-Yes, ma'am.

00:05:05.304 --> 00:05:07.406
-Just some clarification here.
This is unlimited?

00:05:07.406 --> 00:05:09.275
The salad?
-Free, unlimited salad.

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:11.711
-Do we pay for anything?
How do you guys make money here?

00:05:11.711 --> 00:05:14.046
♪♪

00:05:14.046 --> 00:05:16.749
-Extra crispy chicken parms.
-Mmm.

00:05:16.749 --> 00:05:22.154
-Ooh.
-With rigatoni and marinara.

00:05:22.154 --> 00:05:27.660
-That's it right there?
-Mm-hmm.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:31.263
[ Clapping ]

00:05:31.263 --> 00:05:32.998
Rufio! Rufio!

00:05:32.998 --> 00:05:36.035
Rufio! Rufio!

00:05:36.035 --> 00:05:39.138
Feel free to just like dip in
whenever you want.

00:05:39.138 --> 00:05:41.507
♪♪

00:05:41.507 --> 00:05:45.144
-Hey, yo,
It's my friend's birthday.

00:05:45.144 --> 00:05:46.846
-Yes, we do
a complementary birthday cake.

00:05:46.846 --> 00:05:48.447
-Complementary?
-And we sing happy birthday.

00:05:48.447 --> 00:05:49.615
Is that okay?

00:05:49.615 --> 00:05:50.883
-You don't pay for anything
at this place.

00:05:50.883 --> 00:05:51.784
It's unbelievable.

00:05:51.784 --> 00:05:56.956
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

00:05:56.956 --> 00:06:02.561
♪ Happy birthday dear Post ♪

00:06:02.561 --> 00:06:06.665
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪
-Wow.

00:06:06.665 --> 00:06:08.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:08.234 --> 00:06:10.002
-Wow!
That's how you do it.

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:11.303
Hey, I really did
get you something.

00:06:11.303 --> 00:06:12.705
-You did?
-Yeah.

00:06:12.705 --> 00:06:16.942
Back when I did "Late Night"
we would tell everybody,

00:06:16.942 --> 00:06:18.177
"When you're here,
you're family."

00:06:18.177 --> 00:06:19.245
-Mm-hmm.

00:06:19.245 --> 00:06:21.247
-And so the owners
of Olive Garden --

00:06:21.247 --> 00:06:22.881
even though I'd never been
to an Olive Garden --

00:06:22.881 --> 00:06:25.818
they legally gave me the slogan

00:06:25.818 --> 00:06:27.320
"When you're here,
you're family."

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:28.788
Because they were
getting rid of it.

00:06:28.788 --> 00:06:30.689
They were phasing it out
and getting a new slogan.

00:06:30.689 --> 00:06:32.024
-Really?

00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:33.860
-So I legally own "When
you're here, you're family."

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.127
-Wow!

00:06:35.127 --> 00:06:42.401
-And I want to transfer
everything over to you.

00:06:42.401 --> 00:06:44.136
-Jimothy...
No, sir.

00:06:44.136 --> 00:06:47.006
You shouldn't have done this.

00:06:47.006 --> 00:06:48.474
Oh, my God.

00:06:48.474 --> 00:06:52.511
[ Laughter ]

00:06:52.511 --> 00:06:54.379
It's done. It's done.
That's it.

00:06:54.379 --> 00:06:56.815
-How great is that?
-Thank you, guys, so much.

00:06:56.815 --> 00:06:59.118
-Let's get out of here
before I have to pay the bill.

00:06:59.118 --> 00:07:00.319
-Here grab this.
Grab it.

00:07:00.319 --> 00:07:01.821
♪♪

00:07:01.821 --> 00:07:03.990
-Thank you again!
-Thank you!

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.224
-I want to say thank you,
Olive Garden.

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:06.992
Thank you, Post.
You're awesome.

00:07:06.992 --> 00:07:09.695
-Bongiorno.
-Bongiorno!

00:07:09.695 --> 00:07:12.331
-Thanks, Jimothy.

00:07:12.331 --> 00:07:13.632
-You have a little wine
on your nose.

00:07:13.632 --> 00:07:14.834
-Oh.

00:07:14.834 --> 00:07:16.302
♪♪

00:07:16.302 --> 00:07:21.374
[ Cheers and applause ]

